    //   - 1 (_authorizationStates) + 10 (EIP3009 gap) = 11 slots
    //   - 101 (AccessControl reserved) = 101 slots
    //   - ~15 (new V3 variables: 6 mappings + 1 uint32 + 1 array + 1 mapping + 1 struct + 1 mapping)
    //   - Total used: ~138 slots beyond BaseStorage
